        "title": "Name the cells",
        "body": "Write the grid as $3,a,1\\,/\\,b,c,d\\,/\\,2,e,?$. The top-left block sum is $T=3+a+b+c$. Top-right: $a+1+c+d=T$ gives $d=b+2$. Bottom-left: $b+c+2+e=T$ gives $e=a+1$. Bottom-right: $c+d+e+\\,?=T$ gives $c+b+2+a+1+\\,?=a+b+c+3$, so $?=0$.\n\n**Answer: (A) 0**"
